+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "https everywhere, no exceptions": plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts, and internal hosts are held to the same HTTPS requirement as every other host. Certificate verification also stays on for all builds.
